# .claude is a live Claude Code state dir — ignore everything, re-include by hand.
# Must be `.claude/*`, not `.claude/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, which silently killed every negation below.
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately absent — it lives in dotfiles-private (this repo is public).
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/statusline.sh

**/.claude/settings.local.json
